Package: AirSensorQAWorkflow
Type: Package
Title: Air Quality Data Processing, Quality Assurance, and Reporting Tools
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Hung", "Nguyen",
      email = "hmn16@usf.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Provides tools for downloading, processing, validating, and reporting
    air quality sensor data from Clarity, PurpleAir, and related monitoring
    workflows. The package supports automated data extraction, file management,
    quality control, and monthly reporting for air quality monitoring projects.
